      "content": "idk. resistance feels like a lot of work for nothing. it's just... if you look at it logically, there isn't a difference between existing and not existing. it's like a zero sum game. if nothing has inherent meaning, then the value of being here vs not being here is exactly the same. it's all just neutral.",
